WEBVTT

00:00.567 --> 00:09.424
kanashige ni saku hana ni kimi no omokage wo mita

00:00.567 --> 00:09.424
I saw your image in the flower that is blossoming sorrowfully

00:09.937 --> 00:18.509
daisuki na ame nanoni naze ka kyou wa tsumetakute

00:09.937 --> 00:18.509
I love rain, yet it felt frosty today

00:18.651 --> 00:37.226
kisetsu wa meguri mori wa somerare kaze wa kanadete omoi afurete

00:18.651 --> 00:37.226
The season changed, the forest was colored, the wind played a tune, memories overflowed

00:37.600 --> 00:46.786
tsuki no kakera wo atsumete yume wo kazari nemuru

00:37.600 --> 00:46.787
Gather the pieces of the moon, decorate the dream and sleep

00:47.020 --> 00:56.153
toki no suna chiribametemo ano koro e kaeranai

00:47.020 --> 00:56.154
Even if I sprinkle the sand of time, I cannot return to the past

00:56.313 --> 01:05.420
ikiru imi sageshiteiru dare mo mina tabibito

00:56.313 --> 01:05.420
Those searching for the meaning of life are all travellers

01:05.769 --> 01:14.817
haruka naru tabiji tadori boku wa ima arukidasu

01:05.776 --> 01:14.817
I set my course on this endless journey

01:14.837 --> 01:22.812
ibara no michi no mukou e...

01:14.837 --> 01:22.812
for the place beyond the thorny path...

01:25.818 --> 01:30.738
The artist of life who produces miracles
with his godlike scalpel skills.

01:31.657 --> 01:33.992
The surgeon whom the era has yearned for.

01:34.868 --> 01:35.911
Black Jack.

01:48.866 --> 01:51.978
Originally by Tezuka Osamu "A Pirate's Arm"

01:48.866 --> 01:51.978
A Pirate's Arm

01:55.325 --> 01:59.180
Sign: Ichinoseki Attends Highschool Championship!!

01:59.665 --> 02:00.278
Check!

02:04.344 --> 02:05.886
Can we take this back?

02:06.096 --> 02:07.179
No.

02:07.180 --> 02:08.806
We said no taking moves back.

02:08.807 --> 02:10.859
But please?

02:10.932 --> 02:12.768
Don't be a sore loser.

02:12.769 --> 02:14.353
Resign already.

02:16.352 --> 02:18.357
Suzuki, it's your win.

02:18.900 --> 02:21.527
Note: Oh = King, Keima = Knight

02:18.900 --> 02:21.527
Protect Oh with Keima, and check her.

02:21.528 --> 02:24.446
If she escapes, move Hisha to 7-4,

02:21.528 --> 02:24.446
Hisha = Rook

02:25.031 --> 02:25.739
and that's checkmate.

02:29.119 --> 02:30.077
It's true!

02:32.831 --> 02:35.207
Ichinoseki! Don't give him any ideas!

02:35.417 --> 02:38.127
Then play better shogi.

02:38.128 --> 02:40.754
Don't tell me that!

02:41.464 --> 02:42.131
You suck.

02:43.409 --> 02:44.320
I hate you!

02:58.148 --> 03:00.340
Ichinoseki looks like he's coming along.

03:00.650 --> 03:04.528
I hope he can keep this up until the championship.

03:22.505 --> 03:24.745
Ichinoseki, you look great.

03:26.009 --> 03:26.967
What's wrong?

03:27.427 --> 03:28.802
Hey, it's swollen.

03:28.803 --> 03:29.786
Since when?

03:30.096 --> 03:31.650
Since four or five days ago.

03:31.931 --> 03:34.183
But I don't think it's serious.

03:35.185 --> 03:37.019
Your physical condition is crucial.

03:37.020 --> 03:38.020
Be careful.

03:38.021 --> 03:38.687
Yes.

03:38.688 --> 03:40.481
What, captain?

03:40.482 --> 03:42.733
Quit yapping around here.

03:42.734 --> 03:43.150
Go away!

03:43.443 --> 03:45.819
We're the Ichinoseki fan club!

03:45.820 --> 03:47.613
We can't do that!

03:50.992 --> 03:52.874
What is this?

03:53.286 --> 03:56.080
Oana High School's Ichinoseki Kazuo

03:53.286 --> 03:59.306
High School Championship Most Hopeful

03:53.286 --> 03:59.306
Ichinoseki Kazuo of Oana
High School is a new star on the Japanese ...

03:56.082 --> 04:01.920
is seen as a very likely candidate to win the championship.

04:01.966 --> 04:03.854
Wato-san, isn't he...

04:03.973 --> 04:05.502
Yes, in the same class?

04:05.586 --> 04:08.133
He's arrogant, and lacks tact.

04:08.134 --> 04:10.135
Who cares if he wins it he championship?

04:10.553 --> 04:13.514
Doc, what championship?

04:13.515 --> 04:16.475
It's like the Olympics for high schoolers
around the country.

04:18.061 --> 04:21.939
I want to compete in gymnastics in the Olympics, too.

04:29.364 --> 04:32.259
Gymnastics is hard.

04:32.450 --> 04:33.812
Can I have another parfait?

04:33.994 --> 04:34.688
OK!

04:34.953 --> 04:38.580
Pinoco, you might be able to win
at the parfait-eating contest.

04:38.581 --> 04:40.124
Really, Doc?

04:40.125 --> 04:40.791
Yeah.

04:41.259 --> 04:42.639
Yay!

04:42.961 --> 04:46.505
So, where do they hold such a contest?

04:56.224 --> 04:57.859
It's even more swollen than yesterday.

04:58.018 --> 04:59.435
What's going on?

05:00.895 --> 05:03.022
Kazuo, Kozue-chan is here.

05:06.651 --> 05:07.985
Good morning, Icchi.

05:11.531 --> 05:13.115
Wait, lcchi.

05:13.116 --> 05:15.784
Hey, we're going to have a pop quiz in English.

05:15.785 --> 05:16.910
Did you know that?

05:16.936 --> 05:17.411
Toshie,

05:19.039 --> 05:22.182
we're not in kindergarten or elementary school anymore.

05:22.375 --> 05:24.293
I know we've been friends since we were little,

05:24.294 --> 05:25.544
but you don't have to pick me up every morning.

05:25.545 --> 05:26.628
Why?

05:26.629 --> 05:28.009
Do I bother you, lcchi?

05:28.288 --> 05:30.299
Yeah, it's annoying.

05:30.300 --> 05:33.218
Besides, quit calling me lcchi.

05:33.219 --> 05:34.011
Got that?

05:37.766 --> 05:39.124
Ouch...

05:39.447 --> 05:40.476
lcchi!

05:41.102 --> 05:42.519
Is something wrong with your arm?

05:43.063 --> 05:44.355
It's nothing.

05:44.814 --> 05:46.523
It's really nothing.

05:46.524 --> 05:47.524
It's Ichinoseki-san!

05:47.984 --> 05:50.402
Good morning!

05:50.820 --> 05:51.779
Morning!

05:54.032 --> 05:55.658
You guys, let's go together!

05:57.285 --> 05:58.160
Icchi...

05:58.870 --> 06:03.123
I'm super happy that I can go to school with you!

06:26.648 --> 06:27.398
Icchi.

06:28.024 --> 06:28.774
Toshie.

06:30.694 --> 06:31.902
It's swollen badly.

06:33.154 --> 06:33.529
Shut up!

06:34.030 --> 06:35.072
Leave me alone!

06:38.284 --> 06:39.201
Icchi...

06:43.915 --> 06:46.083
I just need to cool it.

06:48.044 --> 06:50.546
Kazuo! What's wrong with your arm?

06:50.547 --> 06:52.047
It's really nothing!

06:52.048 --> 06:53.590
It's not nothing!

06:53.591 --> 06:54.299
It's so swollen!

06:54.884 --> 06:56.760
How do you know about my arm?

06:57.178 --> 06:59.221
Toshie-chan told me over the phone.

06:59.597 --> 07:00.528
Toshie did?

07:00.932 --> 07:02.850
That wench, why did she...

07:02.851 --> 07:05.310
Either way, go see a doctor.

07:05.311 --> 07:06.687
Have him check it out carefully.

07:06.733 --> 07:08.733
Tezuka Hospital

07:08.940 --> 07:09.802
This is...

07:10.191 --> 07:12.651
You're showing symptoms of a very
serious illness called gangrene.

07:12.652 --> 07:13.485
Gangrene?

07:14.279 --> 07:17.531
A part of the body is infected by putrefactive bacteria,

07:17.532 --> 07:19.392
gets rotten, turns dark,

07:19.701 --> 07:21.410
and sometimes emits an odor.

07:21.411 --> 07:22.369
It's a complex condition.

07:22.662 --> 07:23.767
Can it be cured?

07:24.164 --> 07:26.373
I need to see you every day for a while.

07:26.791 --> 07:29.681
Also, you may experience high fevers.

07:30.253 --> 07:31.879
You must give your left arm total rest.

07:32.839 --> 07:33.589
No way!

07:33.965 --> 07:35.758
I'm a gymnast!

07:35.759 --> 07:37.843
The high school championship is in a month, too!

07:38.094 --> 07:40.861
Sir, gymnastics is out of the question!

07:41.014 --> 07:42.097
Absolute rest!

07:42.098 --> 07:44.308
Or else, it can be fatal.

07:44.309 --> 07:44.808
Okay?

07:49.230 --> 07:52.399
A condition of the arm can be fatal?

07:52.400 --> 07:53.594
He's exaggerating.

08:20.970 --> 08:21.883
Doctor!

08:22.138 --> 08:23.722
I'm Kazuo's mother.

08:23.723 --> 08:25.258
How is he?

08:25.517 --> 08:26.658
He has gas gangrene.

08:26.976 --> 08:28.374
I told him to get total rest.

08:28.728 --> 08:32.282
But he still abused his arm, and worsened the condition.

08:32.482 --> 08:33.774
Can he be saved?

08:34.609 --> 08:36.568
Unfortunately, it's too late.

08:39.656 --> 08:41.369
Ma'am! Hang on!

08:42.742 --> 08:44.625
He's suffering from blood poisoning from the gas gangrene.

08:44.911 --> 08:45.912
It's close to being too late.

08:46.246 --> 08:47.997
Please, help me!

08:58.967 --> 08:59.883
What do you think?-

09:01.386 --> 09:04.054
There is no other way other than amputating his arm.

09:04.055 --> 09:05.926
You think so too...

09:06.641 --> 09:09.127
But he's a gymnast.

09:10.145 --> 09:12.646
I heard he's a candidate for the high school championship.

09:12.647 --> 09:13.689
I read it in the newspaper.

09:14.107 --> 09:15.733
To him, his arms are his life.

09:16.192 --> 09:20.163
If he loses one, he will lose his hope for the future.

09:21.406 --> 09:23.449
That's why I wanted your help.

09:24.409 --> 09:27.661
You've recovered from such a condition once, too.

09:28.288 --> 09:31.123
Hey, hey, I might be unlicensed, but I'm still a doctor.

09:31.124 --> 09:32.194
Not a minister.

09:32.500 --> 09:33.259
It's not my business.

09:33.626 --> 09:34.675
Black Jack!

09:34.919 --> 09:35.586
Sorry.

09:35.803 --> 09:36.462
Hey!

09:40.508 --> 09:42.217
You are Dr. Black Jack, right?

09:42.218 --> 09:43.945
Dr. Tezuka told me about you.

09:44.179 --> 09:46.263
He said you are a master surgeon.

09:46.264 --> 09:49.516
Please, save lcchi!

09:50.268 --> 09:51.435
Doctor!

09:51.436 --> 09:52.979
Sorry, but it's too late.

09:53.229 --> 09:54.605
Please!

09:54.606 --> 09:56.609
I have nobody else to turn to!

09:56.733 --> 09:58.108
Please!

09:58.652 --> 10:00.284
Who are you to him?

10:01.071 --> 10:03.030
I'm his classmate.

10:03.031 --> 10:05.491
Doctor, please save him!

10:05.659 --> 10:07.951
Please, Dr. Black Jack!

10:09.329 --> 10:10.788
Fine, I'll try.

10:11.331 --> 10:14.220
But this operation will cost you.

10:15.085 --> 10:15.709
Yes.

10:31.226 --> 10:31.934
Scalpel.

10:38.817 --> 10:41.652
Ichinoseki gives up on the high school championship

10:41.653 --> 10:42.820
due to an operation on his left arm.

10:44.406 --> 10:45.990
Hey, it's Ichinoseki.

10:45.991 --> 10:47.408
Has his arm been treated already?

11:19.451 --> 11:20.701
<i>Is it...</i>

11:20.702 --> 11:23.370
<i>Is my arm that strange?</i>

11:30.962 --> 11:32.671
Check this arm out!

11:32.672 --> 11:35.048
Isn't it funny, like it's 'a pirate's?

11:37.177 --> 11:38.302
Isn't it funny?

11:38.303 --> 11:39.595
Come on, laugh!

11:39.596 --> 11:41.013
Stop that, Ichinoseki.

11:41.014 --> 11:42.202
That's enough.

12:07.624 --> 12:09.500
Are you serious?

12:09.501 --> 12:10.626
I'm serious!

12:10.960 --> 12:14.129
His left hand is a hook like this, and...

12:33.191 --> 12:34.149
Damn!

12:34.150 --> 12:37.319
This hand!

12:38.196 --> 12:38.946
Give me...

12:39.280 --> 12:42.324
Give me back my dream!

12:42.867 --> 12:44.368
Don't ask for the impossible.

12:45.161 --> 12:45.810
Who's that?!

12:45.810 --> 12:46.620
Come out!

12:47.038 --> 12:49.123
Don't scream like that.

12:49.499 --> 12:50.833
I'm right by you.

12:53.002 --> 12:54.169
Could it be...

12:55.046 --> 12:57.089
Yup, I'm your arm.

13:03.680 --> 13:05.931
Doc, we have a guest.

13:09.269 --> 13:10.036
What?

13:10.270 --> 13:13.355
Did you come to thank me for the new arm?

13:13.606 --> 13:15.858
Why did you give me an arm like this?

13:15.859 --> 13:17.985
It makes me look like a pirate!

13:18.486 --> 13:19.194
Oh yeah?

13:19.195 --> 13:20.320
You don't like it?

13:20.864 --> 13:23.779
We have more realistic artificial arms, ,too.

13:24.159 --> 13:26.827
I thought I would ease you in with that one first.

13:27.078 --> 13:28.495
This arm talks.

13:31.666 --> 13:33.292
Here you go.

13:33.793 --> 13:34.877
I'm serious!

13:34.878 --> 13:36.670
The arm really talked!

13:37.672 --> 13:38.881
Come on!

13:38.882 --> 13:40.716
Don't yell so suddenly!

13:44.053 --> 13:47.931
Your mind is too preoccupied
with grief over the loss of your arm.

13:47.932 --> 13:49.391
And you're confused.

13:50.018 --> 13:52.728
But it's the truth.

13:53.229 --> 13:54.809
Face the truth.

13:55.273 --> 13:56.190
Don't look away.

14:04.783 --> 14:06.207
Don't look away...

14:06.409 --> 14:08.243
Face the truth...

14:09.704 --> 14:11.455
You look down.

14:12.499 --> 14:13.415
There it goes again!

14:13.416 --> 14:15.459
Hey, hey, I'm not a ghost.

14:15.460 --> 14:16.960
Don't get so scared!

14:17.378 --> 14:18.504
Don't talk to me like that!

14:18.505 --> 14:19.608
You're only an artificial arm!

14:19.881 --> 14:21.534
I may be artificial, but I'm still your arm!

14:21.716 --> 14:22.841
Don't mock me!

14:23.343 --> 14:25.685
Then do the horizontal bar or the rings!

14:26.012 --> 14:27.221
I can't do those.

14:27.222 --> 14:28.305
See?

14:28.306 --> 14:29.681
Don't talk like you know everything!

14:32.393 --> 14:36.742
With this arm, none of my friends will come near me.

14:37.106 --> 14:39.599
They are not real friends.

14:42.445 --> 14:44.892
What am I supposed to do now?

14:45.240 --> 14:47.324
I have no hope to live for now.

14:48.451 --> 14:49.785
I wish I could die.

14:50.370 --> 14:53.747
If you die, then I will speak badly about you!

14:54.124 --> 14:54.974
What?!

14:55.125 --> 14:57.459
He was extremely perverted!

14:57.460 --> 14:58.919
Who's perverted?!

14:58.920 --> 15:02.464
But you looked happy when you were surrounded by girls!

15:03.675 --> 15:05.211
I couldn't help it back then...

15:05.385 --> 15:07.511
I was annoyed back then!

15:07.512 --> 15:09.680
But you looked happy.

15:11.349 --> 15:12.266
Damn it!

15:12.267 --> 15:13.308
Don't make up stories!

15:18.898 --> 15:20.232
What's wrong, Kazuo?

15:23.528 --> 15:24.594
Cheer up!

15:24.904 --> 15:27.906
You can do something else besides gymnastics!

15:28.408 --> 15:31.493
What can I do other than gymnastics?

15:33.371 --> 15:36.182
I'm no good at studying, either.

15:36.499 --> 15:39.418
Oh yeah, Kazuo, you're good at shogi, aren't you?

15:40.044 --> 15:43.297
How did you know such a stupid thing?

15:43.298 --> 15:44.548
It's not stupid.

15:45.133 --> 15:45.799
That's it!

15:45.800 --> 15:46.934
Play shogi!

15:47.135 --> 15:49.636
Play shogi, and become the best in the school,

15:49.637 --> 15:52.014
no, best in the nation!

15:52.557 --> 15:54.099
You can do it!

15:54.601 --> 15:55.976
Shogi, huh?

15:56.394 --> 15:57.519
I'll be with you!

15:57.520 --> 15:58.650
I'll help you! OK?

16:01.983 --> 16:02.733
That's it!

16:02.734 --> 16:03.624
Let's do it!

16:03.776 --> 16:05.360
Let's play shogi, Kazuo!

16:20.004 --> 16:23.464
Oana High School Shogi Club

16:25.256 --> 16:25.964
Check.

16:26.633 --> 16:27.758
Check!

16:29.264 --> 16:29.924
Check!

16:30.428 --> 16:31.136
What?!

16:31.137 --> 16:33.263
A freshman is going wild in the club house?!

16:33.264 --> 16:33.847
Yes!

16:35.099 --> 16:37.893
I, Tanigawa, captain of the
shogi club, will play against you!

16:38.144 --> 16:39.269
Captain!

17:06.548 --> 17:07.339
I concede.

17:10.969 --> 17:13.595
Ichinoseki-kun, I have a favor to ask.

17:14.055 --> 17:19.893
Can you attend, in my place, the Kanto Area
Shogi Tournament that will be held in a week?

17:20.311 --> 17:23.272
I know you'll come back with good results.

17:23.273 --> 17:25.023
Please, Ichinoseki-kun!

17:27.485 --> 17:29.278
Big news! Big news!

17:29.279 --> 17:32.114
Ichinoseki wiped out the entire shogi club!

17:32.115 --> 17:33.657
No way! Seriously?!

17:33.658 --> 17:36.452
He's attending the Kanto Area
Tournament in place of Tanigawa!

17:37.620 --> 17:38.787
Hey, Ichinoseki.

17:39.998 --> 17:41.201
You're amazing.

17:41.499 --> 17:43.000
Everyone at school's talking about you.

17:43.585 --> 17:44.585
I think highly of you.

17:45.170 --> 17:47.379
Good luck at the Kanto Area Tournament.

17:49.090 --> 17:50.507
Kanto tournament, huh?

17:50.508 --> 17:52.384
Let's go wild, Kazuo!

17:52.385 --> 17:53.051
Yeah.

17:57.307 --> 18:01.844
The Kanto Area High School Shogi Tournament has begun.

18:02.187 --> 18:07.547
It'll be worthwhile to see if anyone can beat
the reigning 2-year champion, Oyama-kun.

18:07.901 --> 18:10.652
Or will Oyama-kun be able to win for the third time?

18:10.653 --> 18:13.530
The first round has already started.

18:17.827 --> 18:18.994
I concede.

18:19.496 --> 18:21.955
Ichinoseki-kun, the hopeful, has cleared the first round.

18:31.966 --> 18:33.175
I concede.

18:34.135 --> 18:36.720
Ichinoseki-kun is victorious again.

18:44.729 --> 18:47.439
The two-year champion Oyama-kun's opponent in the finals

18:47.857 --> 18:51.111
has been determined to be
Ichinoseki Kazuo-kun of Oyama High School.

18:51.528 --> 18:55.072
Ichinoseki-kun is only a newcomer to shogi.

18:55.073 --> 18:57.108
This is indeed an interesting match-up.

19:03.706 --> 19:05.124
Calm down, Kazuo!

19:06.334 --> 19:08.001
At last, the finals!

19:08.002 --> 19:09.545
That's great, Kazuo!

19:09.546 --> 19:10.880
I'm nervous.

19:10.983 --> 19:12.047
Don't worry!

19:12.048 --> 19:13.340
I'm sure you can win.

19:13.341 --> 19:14.299
I'm with you!

19:14.300 --> 19:15.816
Yeah, I know.

19:16.094 --> 19:18.816
I could come this far only because of you.

19:19.180 --> 19:20.764
I won't regret it even if I lose.

19:20.765 --> 19:21.765
Really, thank you.

19:22.851 --> 19:24.268
You sound unusually humble.

19:24.727 --> 19:28.730
I couldn't even think about shogi back then.

19:29.274 --> 19:31.817
I was so depressed that I wanted to die.

19:33.153 --> 19:37.114
You said that you were part of my body then.

19:37.574 --> 19:40.955
You're my only true friend now.

19:41.161 --> 19:42.124
That's right.

19:42.454 --> 19:44.413
You are me and I am you.

19:44.414 --> 19:44.997
Yeah.

19:51.254 --> 19:53.380
<i>Is that the sound of the wall clock?</i>

19:53.840 --> 19:55.007
<i>Why is that?</i>

20:05.101 --> 20:05.958
<i>This is it.</i>

20:06.227 --> 20:07.603
<i>It's the sound of this clock.</i>

20:20.909 --> 20:22.852
Kazuo, it's six o'clock.

20:22.852 --> 20:24.244
It's time for the finals!

20:25.205 --> 20:26.330
Are you ready?

20:27.457 --> 20:28.095
Kazuo?

20:28.291 --> 20:28.999
What's wrong?

20:29.000 --> 20:29.958
Are you listening?

20:29.959 --> 20:30.626
Kazuo!

20:31.252 --> 20:32.586
Yeah, I am.

20:32.587 --> 20:33.128
I'm listening.

20:34.255 --> 20:36.965
If you win this, it's the National Tournament next!

20:41.012 --> 20:42.012
Good luck!

20:43.014 --> 20:44.014
Can I win this?

20:45.141 --> 20:46.308
Be confident!

20:46.466 --> 20:47.434
I'm sure you can.

20:47.435 --> 20:48.727
I'm with you.

20:49.896 --> 20:50.687
Yeah.

20:50.688 --> 20:51.814
You're right.

20:52.690 --> 20:54.107
Then go!

20:54.818 --> 20:55.484
Yeah.

20:59.614 --> 21:01.365
<i>Thank you, Toshie.</i>

21:06.246 --> 21:08.080
So, how's the artificial arm?

21:08.623 --> 21:10.543
Do you still hate the pirate-like arm?

21:10.750 --> 21:12.626
No, I like it.

21:12.627 --> 21:14.128
I really like it.

21:14.420 --> 21:15.003
I see.

21:15.505 --> 21:17.150
But if you get tired of it,

21:17.423 --> 21:20.884
I can always switch it to a
normal-looking artificial arm any time.

21:21.302 --> 21:23.263
No, I'll go with it.

21:23.471 --> 21:25.347
I need this.

21:26.933 --> 21:29.852
Thank you, Dr. Black Jack.

21:30.270 --> 21:30.870
Yeah.

21:31.229 --> 21:34.523
I'll collect the surgery fee once you grow up.

21:35.191 --> 21:35.858
Yes.

22:07.080 --> 22:19.035
I love you darling. If I can be united with you,

22:07.080 --> 22:19.035
daisukuyo anata to hitotsu ni nareru no nara

22:19.153 --> 22:24.152
I couldn't be happier...

22:19.153 --> 22:24.152
konna shiawase wa naiwa...

22:25.721 --> 22:31.190
I wanted to see you forever

22:25.721 --> 22:31.190
zutto aitakute mattetano

22:31.734 --> 22:37.192
I'm laying on the grill,

22:31.734 --> 22:37.192
ami no ue ni yasashiku nekasete

22:37.796 --> 22:40.281
being heated up by you,

22:37.796 --> 22:40.281
anata ni hoterasarete

22:40.490 --> 22:48.267
so much that I change color

22:40.490 --> 22:48.267
atashi wa iro ga kawarukurai

22:48.352 --> 23:00.121
I dress up with sparkly grains of decorations

22:48.352 --> 23:00.121
kirakira hikaru tsubu no kazari de oshare

23:00.329 --> 23:12.060
I love you darling. Please love me more and more...

23:00.329 --> 23:12.060
daisukiyo motto motto atashi wo aishite

23:12.300 --> 23:23.651
I love you darling. If I can be united with you,

23:12.300 --> 23:23.651
daisukiyo anata to hitotsu no nareru no nara

23:23.837 --> 23:28.758
I couldn't be happier

23:23.837 --> 23:28.758
konna shiawase wa naiwa...

23:28.986 --> 23:33.920
How does it taste?

23:28.986 --> 23:33.919
oaji wa ikaga?

23:45.081 --> 24:15.059
Move, Solomon

23:45.634 --> 23:47.135
Wow, it's moving!

23:47.561 --> 23:48.196
Ani...

23:48.294 --> 23:49.753
Mator?!

23:49.834 --> 23:52.919
We are engineers who give life to drawings!

23:53.629 --> 23:55.005
Animation is not child's play!

23:55.464 --> 23:56.329
Drawings are drawings.

23:56.757 --> 23:57.799
They would be ghosts if they were alive.

24:00.636 --> 24:05.598
I might not be able to keep my
promise of making a living animation.

24:06.267 --> 24:08.852
It's impossible with the support level of this hospital.

24:09.270 --> 24:10.729
But l can...

24:11.188 --> 24:13.732
Next Karte - Move, Solomon

24:16.110 --> 24:17.694
Karte NG...

24:18.946 --> 24:19.821
I'm serious...

24:21.606 --> 24:22.206
Pinoco!

24:22.319 --> 24:22.819
Cut!

24:22.893 --> 24:24.533
I've done it!
